 R←Test_ListRepos_004(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list;rc;msg;stop;cfgFilename
⍝ Exercise ]GitHub.ListRepos without specifying an owner (should use the default owner)
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 cfgFilename←##.GitHub.GetConfigFilename
 'Create!'##.GitHub.FilesAndDirs.CheckPath ##.GitHub.GetPathToConfig
 (⊂'{owner: "aplteam",}')⎕NPUT cfgFilename
 stop←0
 (rc msg list)←stop UCMD'ListRepos'
 →T.GoToTidyUp rc≠0
 →T.GoToTidyUp 2≠⍴⍴list
 →T.GoToTidyUp~10<≢list

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}##.GitHub.FilesAndDirs.DeleteFile cfgFilename
⍝Done
